{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1418132-confusion-with-some-mechanics","id":1418132,"title":"Confusion With Some Mechanics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-13T20:06:04-07:00","id":1418132,"title":"Confusion With Some Mechanics","content":"I'm looking at the rules for Trinity Continuum and the Aberrant Manuscript, as I'm super excited for the release of the later, but I'm confused about a few things.<br /> <br /> Is there any way for Aberrants to get static boosts to their Defense, or is it just taking a defensive action? Always having a Defense of 1 seems super weird.<br /> <br /> I see that Mega-Might provides a straight damage bonus to attacks, but it doesn't seem that Mega-Stamina provides a bonus to toughness; is this intentional? I ask because Mega-Might says Mega-Stamina increases the defensive Scale, but Mega-Stamina doesn't explicitly say this.<br /> <br /> The bonus to initiative scale is a bit strange for Mega-Cunning. It says it increases the Scale, but is that ONLY if Cunning is rolled for initiative, or is it Dexterity as well?<br /> <br /> For Mega-Attributes in general, are they not counted as dots for other purposes? If, say, a character has 4 dots in Stamina, granting them an extra Injured box, does getting one dot of Mega-Stamina grant them another Bruised box?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/899-the-free-man","name":"The Free Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar899_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T20:22:50-07:00","id":1418134,"title":"","content":"On the Defense, With a higher Stamina and higher durability the character defense increases almost automatically. The Deflection power is a good way to deal with mega dodgy characters, it\u2019s not static boost, but it is increases the defense a lot.<br /> <br /> As far it was commented, Might being more effective than Stamina is intentional.<br /> <br /> Scale on Initiative means you roll first and other scales don\u2019t compete with you. So you just roll if there is another character to compete with you. Anyway, as far as I understand it applies to all initiative rolls.<br /> <br /> Mega attributes don\u2019t count as dots. Mega Stamina don\u2019t grants extra health, the character needs Dense Flesh Mega Edge to that.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-13T22:24:56-07:00","id":1418145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1418132-confusion-with-some-mechanics?p=1418134#post1418134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As far it was commented, Might being more effective than Stamina is intentional.</div> </div> </div> </div>I get that, but Mega-Might says &quot;The nova receives the benefit of Dramatic Scale when inflicting damage through sheer Might: 2 Enhancement per difference between the nova's Mega-Might Scale and the target's defensive Scale, such as Mega-Stamina or Durability&quot;<br /> <br /> So I'm guessing this is a typo, and Mega-Stamina doesn't effect defensive Scale by default?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/899-the-free-man","name":"The Free Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar899_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"144"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T03:57:48-07:00","id":1418169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Free Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1418132-confusion-with-some-mechanics?p=1418145#post1418145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I'm guessing this is a typo, and Mega-Stamina doesn't effect defensive Scale by default?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was probably left there after some change in the way Mega Sta works. Sorry I didn\u2019t get it first time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-14T04:29:55-07:00","id":1418173,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Free Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1418132-confusion-with-some-mechanics?p=1418145#post1418145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I get that, but Mega-Might says &amp;quot;The nova receives the benefit of Dramatic Scale when inflicting damage through sheer Might: 2 Enhancement per difference between the nova's Mega-Might Scale and the target's defensive Scale, such as Mega-Stamina or Durability&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> So I'm guessing this is a typo, and Mega-Stamina doesn't effect defensive Scale by default?</div> </div> </div> </div>It\u2019s very difficult to provide meaningful comment on how TC: Aberrant works when we know the developers were implementing changes based on feedback from the Kickstarter, but we don\u2019t know what these are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}